# Screen Navigation

- Registry: screens object in src/screens.tsx is source of truth
- ScreenKey derived from keyof typeof screens
- Navigate: useScreen().navigate(screenKey, { direction, type })
- Hydration: ScreenProvider decides initial screen from vault state - don't bypass
- Screen components should use hooks directly (component autonomy)
- Keep data-testid and visible labels stable for E2E
